CalldataSliceLib::sliceUint128
├── given zero value
│   ├── it should return 0
│   └── it should return offset + 16
├── given max value
│   ├── it should return type(uint128).max
│   └── it should return offset + 16
├── given value at offset
│   ├── it should read from correct position
│   └── it should return offset + 16
└── given trailing data after uint128
    └── it should not include trailing bytes in result